  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the sushi rice thoroughly and cook according to package instructions.",
    "Heat the olive oil on the tava griddle over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the shrimp to the griddle and cook for 2-3 minutes per side, until pink and fully cooked.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the soy sauce, date syrup, and sesame seeds.",
    "Brush the cooked shrimp with the soy sauce mixture.",
    "Fluff the cooked sushi rice with a fork and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "To assemble the sushi, place a small amount of sushi rice onto the griddle and top with a cooked shrimp.",
    "Use the griddle to shape the sushi into a rectangular shape.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
